# Protected Areas (Think Twice Before Editing)
- CRT and dithering shaders: keep retro look; tune via params, not rewrites.
- Autoload registrations in `project.godot`: add new cautiously; prefer existing systems.
- Core factories/managers: extend rather than fork; keep interfaces stable.

# Change Policy
- Prefer small, reversible edits.
- When changing behavior, update docs/configs and run lints.
- Do not bypass pooling/spawn systems for quick fixes.